        "original_id": "9a6a26a6-318e-55b5-9536-a516479ffd93",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ritesh Sidhwani, Farhan Akhtar, Karan Anshuman, Aamir Khan, Saif Ali Khan, Akshaye Khanna, Preity Zinta, Sonali Kulkarni, Dimple Kapadia, Riteish Deshmukh, Pulkit Samrat, Chandan Roy Sanyal\n- Companies: Excel Entertainment Pvt. Ltd.\n- Films: Dil Chahta Hai, Bangistan\n- Roles: film producer, director, actor\n\nFacts:\n- Ritesh Sidhwani, born in 1973, is a Bollywood film producer.\n- Ritesh Sidhwani founded the film production house Excel Entertainment Pvt. Ltd.\n- Along with his long-time friend Farhan Akhtar, Ritesh Sidhwani brought Dil Chahta Hai to audiences as the first film under his banner.\n- Dil Chahta Hai is a 2001 Indian comedy-drama film.\n- Dil Chahta Hai stars Aamir Khan, Saif Ali Khan, Akshaye Khanna, Preity Zinta, Sonali Kulkarni, and Dimple Kapadia.\n- Bangistan is a 2015 Bollywood comedy satire film directed by Karan Anshuman.\n- Bangistan was produced by Farhan Akhtar and Ritesh Sidhwani.\n- Bangistan stars Riteish Deshmukh, Pulkit Samrat, and Chandan Roy Sanyal in lead roles.",
